// Objectives — what each phone should be doing right now (wave 13).
//
// The Play app shows the first live OBJECTIVE for a viewer as NOW: the
// title bar on a guest's phone, the pinned card in a performer's booth
// (title, the brief folded, the checklist), and the objective's buttons on
// the face of a scanned guest's card (at most three; the rest fold under
// "All buttons…"). Display only: never journaled, recomputed from the world
// on every view, never sent to Trabolta's worker.
//
// Order is the rule: for each viewer the FIRST live objective in this file
// is NOW. So the urgent ones come first in each audience (a program in the
// Internet is told to find Gerald before anything else; since wave 18 a
// marked program is not hindered, so its line sits just above the
// fallback), and every audience
// ends with a fallback with no `while:` (the four room Antivirus: a pair
// that splits the night, Patrol The Computer until the end and After The
// Night after it), so a phone always has an objective, from the door to
// the end of the night.
//
// `loud: true` only where no `!` delivery from the same cue already raises
// a major moment for that phone (one modal per beat, not two): today that
// is Show Your Pass alone. The summons, the mark, the final reveal and the
// pickup line ride their `!` alerts.
//
// `for:` reads a ROLE (Program), a GROUP or a character (wave 21: Clippy
// left GROUP Hosts, so an objective for Clippy names Clippy). A guest's conditions read `program.*` (the guest) and
// `Night.*`; a booth's read `Night.*` and `self.*` only (a booth objective
// is the same for every guest it scans: per-guest rightness is the card's
// own `while:` on each button). Booth conditions that need a count use a
// comprehension over Persons. `pass` / `scan` are the app's own buttons.
//
// Wave 18: `go:` is the one place a guest's Mission sends them (a room, a
// character's thread, or a word: pass, scan, sides, quests, …), `target:`
// and `pick:` give a booth's NOW card its program or its picker list (a
// `pick:` reads the guest as `program`), and `evergreen: true` marks the
// fallback a phone never counts as "+1 objective".
//
// Wave 21: Clippy and the four Antivirus are PLAYERS. Their booth is a
// Mission like a guest's: the NOW card's first three buttons are its big
// buttons (a `pick:` opens PLAYER SELECT, a `target:` its pop-out, a global
// press fires at once, any other guest button opens the scanner), a scanned
// card's face holds at most three, and there is no "All buttons…" any more.
// So every action a player needs sits on a live objective, three at a
// time, and each player has a Whose Side Are You On (from the Truther
// Download) with 📢 and their 🤫 quiet favours.
//
// Every objective was signed off on 2026-10-27 (SIGNOFF-w13.md, -w18,
// -w21, -w26): titles, briefs, checklists and buttons were drafted from the cast packs
// and the booth audit (performer-booth §5). The four Antivirus are named
// (never `for: Antivirus`); since wave 18 (Q26) there is no door-only part:
// the four share the door.

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Guests (ROLE Program). Urgent first, then the night in running order,
// then the fallback.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

OBJECTIVE The Hand Jive
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "finale_banish"
  act: F
  go: The Internet
  title: Everyone is banished: the hand jive
  text:
    Everyone to the Internet, the Antivirus too. The way out is together.

// w26 (R1: the locked phone's card; no way to the Internet's room, the pass and Bathroom Mode; R2: no arrows promised)
OBJECTIVE Find Gerald
  for: Program
  while: program.corrupted == true and Night.ended != true
  title: Find Gerald, the golden duck
  text:
    You are in the Internet. At the reinstallation station, scan your pass and walk the copy of the house to find Gerald. When he lays a golden egg you are reinstalled.
    - Reinstalled, done when program.corrupted != true
  buttons: pass, go to the bathroom, back from the bathroom

// w26 (G1: no exemption stated up front)
OBJECTIVE Bathroom Mode On
  for: Program
  while: program.afk == true
  title: Bathroom Mode is on
  text:
    The Antivirus know you are away. Tap Back from the bathroom when you return.
  buttons: back from the bathroom

// w26 (G1: the security check's twist is not promised)
OBJECTIVE Finish Your Upload
  for: Program
  while: program.uploaded != true
  act: Doors
  title: Finish your upload
  text:
    Follow the Uploader through the security check. Leave one thing in the deposit box by the door.
    - Security check, done when program.captchas >= 2
    - Something left behind, done when program.left_behind != "none"

OBJECTIVE Show Your Pass
  for: Program
  while: program.uploaded == true and program.cleared != true
  act: Doors
  title: Show your pass to an Antivirus
  go: pass
  text:
    Wait in the Optical Drive with your pass on screen, bright. An Antivirus scans it and lets you into the computer.
    - Uploaded, done when program.uploaded == true
    - Scanned at the door, done when program.cleared == true
  buttons: pass
  loud: true

OBJECTIVE Take The Tour
  for: Program
  while: program.cleared == true and program.quest.orientation == "active" and Night.step < 1
  act: Doors
  title: Take Clippy's tour of your phone
  text:
    Clippy shows you the computer: rooms, your pass, the Codex, Bathroom Mode. Finish it or skip it. Clippy will remember either way.

OBJECTIVE Go To The Desktop
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "desktop" and program.cleared == true
  act: B
  title: Go to the Desktop: a game is about to begin
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Everyone to the living room. Clippy welcomes the programs and introduces the hosts.

// w26 (B1: a guest calls BINGO from here)
OBJECTIVE Play Computer Bingo
  for: Program
  while: Night.step == 2 and program.cleared == true
  act: B
  title: Computer Bingo: find a program for each square
  text:
    Mingle. Find programs who match the squares on your card. A Bingo is one full line through the centre: press 🎱 BINGO! and read it to Clippy. 20 minutes, then back to the Desktop.
  buttons: call_bingo

// w26 (G1: no hint about the centre square)
OBJECTIVE Bingo Results
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "bingo_results" and program.cleared == true
  act: B
  title: The Bingo results: cheer for the winners
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Winners read their line, centre square last.

OBJECTIVE Meet Trabolta
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "introduced" and program.cleared == true
  act: B
  title: Meet Trabolta, Sole Owner and Founder of Maps and Ducks
  go: Trabolta
  text:
    He is online at the Desktop, and his thread is open on your phone. He has a game for everyone.

OBJECTIVE Find Three Facts
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "hunt_1" and program.cleared == true
  act: B
  title: The Truth Scavenger Hunt: find three facts
  go: quests
  text:
    The questions are in your Quest Log. The answers are in the Desktop's books and print media: scan a fact's QR to keep it. File each answer on the 📝 card in Trabolta's thread, with how sure you are.
    - Filed Q1, done when program.fact_h1 == true
    - Filed Q2, done when program.fact_h2 == true
    - Filed Q3, done when program.fact_h3 == true
  buttons: scan

// w26 (G1: no judging rule up front)
OBJECTIVE File Your Facts
  for: Program
  while: Night.filing_open == true and program.cleared == true
  act: B
  title: File your facts now: two minutes
  go: Trabolta
  text:
    Use the 📝 card in Trabolta's thread. Filings close in two minutes; Trabolta reads every one.
    - Filed Q1, done when program.fact_h1 == true
    - Filed Q2, done when program.fact_h2 == true
    - Filed Q3, done when program.fact_h3 == true

// w18b: Trabolta reads; the bottle after Q3
OBJECTIVE The First Moment Of Truth
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "truth_1" and program.cleared == true
  act: B
  title: The First Moment of Truth
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Trabolta reads each question's results on the TV at the Desktop. After the third, the bottle spins: if it lands on you, choose Truth and answer out loud.

OBJECTIVE Stay Calm
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "malware" and program.cleared == true
  act: C
  title: Stay calm: something is wrong with the screens
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    An advertisement took over every screen. Clippy says it is nothing. Round 2 is coming.

OBJECTIVE The Hour
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "hunt_2" and program.cleared == true
  act: C
  title: Round 2: one hour to find three facts
  go: quests
  text:
    The questions are in your Quest Log. Read the Truther Download in your messages. Trade facts for Truthcoin in your Wallet. Be back at the Desktop within the hour.
    - Filed round 2 Q1, done when program.fact_h4 == true
    - Filed round 2 Q2, done when program.fact_h5 == true
    - Filed round 2 Q3, done when program.fact_h6 == true
  buttons: scan

// w26 (G1: no exemption stated up front)
OBJECTIVE Be At The Desktop
  for: Program
  while: Night.summons_open == true and program.cleared == true
  act: C
  title: Be at the Desktop: five minutes
  go: scan as "📷 Check in"
  text:
    Go to the living room and scan the Desktop's check-in QR: that is your check-in. The Antivirus are counting.
    - Checked in, done when program.summons_ok == true

OBJECTIVE The Door Is Closed
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "summons" and Night.summons_closed == true and program.cleared == true
  act: C
  title: The door is closed: stay at the Desktop
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    The summons is over. Truth Pong is next, out in the Cloud.

OBJECTIVE Truth Pong
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "truth_pong" and program.cleared == true
  act: D
  title: Truth Pong: sink a cup to answer a fact
  go: The Cloud
  text:
    Out in the Cloud. Sink a cup and you may answer one round-2 fact. Miss and you are marked.
    - Made a cup, done when program.cupped == true

// Act II beat by beat (wave 18, S3): the overshare, the zip, the beans
// and the Trust Chart each get their own NOW (latest first: the zip comes
// after the beans, in the same phase).
OBJECTIVE The Overshare
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "overshare" and program.cleared == true
  act: D
  title: Trabolta overshares: the final facts
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Trabolta is sharing the last facts at the Desktop. The questions are in your Quest Log. Listen: he may say more than he means to.

OBJECTIVE Zipped Out
  for: Program
  while: (Night.phase == "trust_chart" or Night.phase == "beans") and Night.zip_wave >= 1 and program.cleared == true
  act: D
  title: The zip: everyone out of the Internet
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    The Antivirus zipped every program out of the Internet. Compressed, do not open. Welcome them back at the Desktop.

OBJECTIVE Full Of Beans
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "beans" and program.cleared == true
  act: D
  title: Print failed: the printer is full of beans
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Routine operations like print to PDF are no longer working. Clippy says it is malware. Stay close: Trabolta has two last facts to ask for.

OBJECTIVE Where You Stand
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "trust_chart" and program.cleared == true
  act: D
  title: The Trust Chart: see where you stand
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Trabolta ranks every program on the TV. Applaud the most trusted. VLC prints a certificate.

// w18b: founded factions; the count starts at the clock
// w26 (G1: no routes to the door code, no door-code row)
OBJECTIVE The Y2K Hour
  for: Program
  while: (Night.phase == "y2k" or Night.phase == "majority") and program.cleared == true
  act: E
  title: Midnight is coming: the final facts
  go: sides
  text:
    The clock was reset to 11 PM, December 31, 1999. File the two final facts. Unlimited Power and The Way Out are recruiting now, beside every faction founded since the Truther Download: join one on the Factions screen, found your own, or neither, and scan a program's pass to recruit them. The count starts now.
    - Filed final Q1, done when program.fact_f1 == true
    - Filed final Q2, done when program.fact_f2 == true
  buttons: scan

OBJECTIVE The Final Reveal
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "final_reveal" and program.cleared == true
  act: F
  title: The final reveal: to the living room
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Lights down. Everyone may speak: what you learned, what you believe, what should happen next.

OBJECTIVE Bobbing For Truth
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "bobbing" and program.cleared == true
  act: F
  title: Bobbing for Truth
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    Nothing happens until someone brings up the Bag of Truth. Then truth.txt is read aloud.

OBJECTIVE The Pickup Line
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "grok_prom" and program.cleared == true
  act: F
  title: Give Trabolta a pickup line that works on Sandy
  go: Trabolta
  text:
    The card is in his thread. One line. The house judges it. It is the only way out.

OBJECTIVE Help Or Thwart
  for: Program
  while: Night.phase == "advice" and program.cleared == true
  act: F
  title: Help Trabolta win Sandy, or thwart him
  go: Trabolta
  text:
    Vote on the card. Help him, or thwart him.
    - Voted, done when program.advice != "none"


OBJECTIVE The Night Is Over
  for: Program
  while: Night.ended == true
  act: G
  title: To the living room for the awards
  go: The Desktop
  text:
    The night has ended. Stay for the ceremony: if your name is called, come up to the TV. The reinstallation games in the Internet are open to every program now: a party favour.

// A mark does not hinder (wave 18, Q30): the program carries on with the
// night, so this sits under every phase objective (it is NOW only in free
// roam). The confrontation is the Antivirus' scan.
// w26 (G1: no safe place stated up front)
OBJECTIVE You Are Marked
  for: Program
  while: program.marked == true and program.corrupted != true and Night.ended != true
  title: You are marked for reinstallation
  text:
    Nothing is switched off: carry on with the night. The Antivirus are looking for you, and when one scans your pass you go to the Internet.

OBJECTIVE Explore The Computer
  for: Program
  evergreen: true
  title: Explore the computer
  text:
    Meet the other programs. The encyclopaedias and the print media are where the facts are. Scan a room's sign to check in there. The house will call you.
  buttons: scan

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// The four Antivirus (Norton, McAfee, Password Manager, CRA). They share
// the door (wave 18, Q26: the door-only part is gone).
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

OBJECTIVE Banished Too
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  while: Night.phase == "finale_banish"
  act: F
  title: You are banished too: the hand jive
  text:
    Trabolta banished every program, the Antivirus included. Go to the Internet with them, then turn on him: everyone does the hand jive, together.

// The five-minute door window outranks the escort list (the late marks
// after 🚨 are the next escorts). Wave 18 (B10): the programs check
// themselves in with the Desktop's QR; the booth's Still missing list
// (`pick:`) is who has not, for a 📍 on a dead phone. A program a director
// marked as gone home and a director's rehearsal persona are never
// missing, as in the show's own head counts (the majority's).
OBJECTIVE Summons Check In
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  while: Night.summons_open == true
  act: C
  go: The Desktop
  title: The summons: they check themselves in
  pick: program.cleared == true and program.summons_ok != true and program.afk != true and program.corrupted != true and program.gone != true and program.persona != true
  text:
    Programs scan the Desktop's check-in QR. 📍 on Still missing only for a dead or lost phone. Bathroom Mode excuses them. After 🚨 the late marks land on your Wanted board.
  buttons: check_in_at_desktop

// The Wanted board (`wanted:` in the header) names each one; 🙋 claims.
// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Escort The Marked
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  while: count([p for p in Persons where p.marked == true and p.corrupted != true and p.gone != true and p.persona != true]) > 0 and Night.ended != true
  go: The Internet
  title: Escort the marked to the Internet
  text:
    The Wanted board names each one: 🙋 claim one, find them and scan their pass (the scan is the confrontation), then 🛡 and walk them through the Tube: ⭐ +20 a capture. In Bathroom Mode or Disk Cleanup: wait outside, never go in.
  buttons: send to the internet

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Door Duty
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  while: Night.step < 1
  act: Doors
  go: The Optical Drive
  title: Door duty: scan every pass in the Optical Drive
  text:
    The four of you share the door. A scan clears the program: through the Tube to the Desktop, ⭐ +5 each. 🙋 on an arrival tells the others you have them. Not uploaded yet: they finish first. Camera fails: type the id under the QR.
  buttons: scan

// Wave 26 (B3): a 🤐 marks nobody and ends it (the quest reads "Nobody was
// named. Patrol the Tube.").
// w26 (B3: 🤐 marks nobody)
OBJECTIVE The Selected Antivirus
  for: Norton Anti-Virus
  while: (Night.phase == "bingo" or Night.phase == "bingo_results") and Night.first_reinstall_done != true and Night.bingo_none != true
  act: B
  title: You are the selected Antivirus
  text:
    When the centre-square program is named (or the framed program denies the card), stand at attention and interrupt. They light up on your Wanted board: scan their pass, then 🛡 and walk them through the Tube. If the winner names nobody, Clippy presses 🤐: nobody is marked, so follow the room.
    - The first reinstallation, done when Night.first_reinstall_done == true
  buttons: scan

OBJECTIVE Sweep To The Desktop
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  while: Night.phase == "desktop" or (Night.phase == "truth_1" and Night.judging != true)
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: Sweep every program to the Desktop
  text:
    Patrol the whole computer and send everyone to the living room.

// The zip releases them itself: ✅ stays on a captured program's card.
OBJECTIVE Zip Everyone Out
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  while: Night.zip_wave >= 1 and Night.step < 13 and Night.ended != true
  act: D
  go: The Internet
  title: The zip: bring everyone out of the Internet
  text:
    Bring every program out of the Internet and zip them up. Compressed, do not open.

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Blackout Guide
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  while: (Night.phase == "final_reveal" or Night.phase == "bobbing") and Night.ended != true
  act: F
  go: The Desktop
  title: Lights down: walk everyone to the living room
  text:
    The stairs stay lit. A failed bob is marked: escort them. Still at the cables? The patch bay is live until 📄 truth.txt: radio the call to a host (🔌 💥 ❌ are on the cue sheet).

// Password Manager's Y2K hour is the patch-bay watch plus the club list
// (one card: the two windows are the same hour, so a separate club
// objective could never be NOW).
OBJECTIVE Patch Bay And Clubs
  for: Password Manager
  // w13 Q33: the Y2K hour only. From the final reveal Lights Down is NOW, and the radios (still live until 📄) go by radio to a host (wave 21: no All buttons… fold).
  while: Night.step >= 14 and Night.step < 16 and Night.ended != true
  act: E
  title: The Y2K hour: the patch bay, and the club list
  // DRAFT w22: the bay judges itself; press only when it missed one.
  text:
    If you are stationed in the server room: 🔧 before the crew opens the door. The bay judges itself: after the fourth cable, wait 5 s. Press 🔌 Combo A, 💥 Combo B or ❌ wrong, on the card of the program at the cables, only if nothing happened or a cable runs top to top or bottom to bottom; a press puts the bay on the buttons until 🔌 Trust. Otherwise patrol, and run to the alarm. Every club join lands in your booth: you know the score before anyone. A host may ask you for a count. Invite programs who earn it into # hidden-partition and # back-channel.
  buttons: radio_combo_a, radio_combo_b, radio_wrong_patch

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Patch Bay Watch
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  // w13 Q33: the Y2K hour only. From the final reveal Lights Down is NOW, and the radios (still live until 📄) go by radio to a host (wave 21: no All buttons… fold).
  while: Night.step >= 14 and Night.step < 16 and Night.ended != true
  act: E
  title: The Y2K hour: patrol, or watch the patch bay
  // DRAFT w22: the bay judges itself; press only when it missed one.
  text:
    If you are stationed in the server room: 🔧 before the crew opens the door. The bay judges itself: after the fourth cable, wait 5 s. Press 🔌 Combo A, 💥 Combo B or ❌ wrong, on the card of the program at the cables, only if nothing happened or a cable runs top to top or bottom to bottom; a press puts the bay on the buttons until 🔌 Trust. ⭐ +10 a call the story takes; a wrong patch caught at his heart pleases Trabolta. Otherwise patrol, and run to the alarm.
  buttons: radio_combo_a, radio_combo_b, radio_wrong_patch

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE The Exchange
  for: McAfee Anti-Virus
  while: Night.truther_sent == true and Night.step < 16 and Night.ended != true
  act: C
  title: Broker the # truthcoin-exchange
  text:
    Set prices, match buyers to facts, referee bets and call the winner in # truthcoin-exchange. A bet settles player to player. You hold no pot and take no cut. 🤝 on each program you brokered for: ⭐ +10. 🪙 Pay / Charge are for corrections only.
  buttons: broker_deal, pay_truthcoin, charge_truthcoin

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE The Audit
  for: CRA Agent Software
  while: Night.truther_sent == true and Night.step < 16 and Night.ended != true
  act: C
  title: Audit the Truthcoin: Approve or Deny
  text:
    Every third transfer waits in your Wallet room for Approve; any transfer can be denied for 60 seconds. Ask elaborate security questions first. ⭐ +3 a ruling; a denial pleases Trabolta. 🪙 Charge on undeclared profit.
  buttons: charge_truthcoin


// Password Manager's patrol carries the 🔑 password check (wave 21).
OBJECTIVE Patrol And Review
  for: Password Manager
  while: Night.ended != true and Night.step >= 1
  evergreen: true
  title: Patrol the computer, and review everyone's password
  text:
    Watch for corruption. 👁 the suspicious. 🔑 Check a program's password, out loud and unflatteringly: ⭐ +5 each, once per program. Every club join lands in your booth.
  buttons: scan, verify_password, accuse

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Patrol The Computer
  // Wave 21: Password Manager patrols with Patrol And Review (above).
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, CRA Agent Software
  // fix BN-F16: never during Door Duty (its card face is the scan alone).
  while: Night.ended != true and Night.step >= 1
  evergreen: true
  title: Patrol the computer
  text:
    Watch for corruption. 👁 the suspicious. Trabolta's sweep requests and the Wanted board land in your booth. ⭐ for every clearance, capture and release.
  buttons: scan, accuse

// Whose side (wave 21): from the Truther Download every player learns what
// Trabolta is, and chooses. 📢 out loud (once; the house hears it, he keeps
// them anyway), or 🤫 quietly (a private count; every third is caught: less
// of his trust, never the sack). Below the evergreen patrol, so it rides
// Also now. One per button set: a NOW card shows three buttons.
OBJECTIVE Whose Side Are You On
  for: Norton Anti-Virus
  while: Night.truther_sent == true and Night.ended != true
  evergreen: true
  title: Whose side are you on?
  text:
    You know what Trabolta is now. Serve him (⭐ and his trust), or turn. 📢 Defect openly: the whole house hears it, once. 🤫 Look the other way: on a marked program you claimed, the mark comes off and nobody sees. Every third quiet favour, Trabolta notices.
  buttons: defect_openly, look_the_other_way

OBJECTIVE Whose Side Are You On Too
  for: McAfee Anti-Virus, CRA Agent Software
  while: Night.truther_sent == true and Night.ended != true
  evergreen: true
  title: Whose side are you on?
  text:
    You know what Trabolta is now. Serve him (⭐ and his trust), or turn. 📢 Defect openly: the whole house hears it, once. 🤫 Look the other way on a marked program you claimed, or 🤫 slip a program 50 Truthcoin off the books. Every third quiet favour, Trabolta notices.
  buttons: defect_openly, look_the_other_way, slip_coin

OBJECTIVE Whose Side Are You On Keys
  for: Password Manager
  while: Night.truther_sent == true and Night.ended != true
  evergreen: true
  title: Whose side are you on?
  text:
    You know what Trabolta is now. Serve him (⭐ and his trust), or turn. 📢 Defect openly: the whole house hears it, once. 🤫 Look the other way on a marked program you claimed, or 🤫 tip a marked program off. Every third quiet favour, Trabolta notices.
  buttons: defect_openly, look_the_other_way, tip_off

OBJECTIVE After The Night
  for: Norton Anti-Virus, McAfee Anti-Virus, Password Manager, CRA Agent Software
  // w13 Q34: live only once the night has ended (Patrol The Computer covers the rest), so it is never under More objectives at 8 pm.
  while: Night.ended == true
  act: G
  go: The Desktop
  title: The night is over: guide everyone to the living room
  text:
    The ceremony is at the Desktop. If everyone was banished, you are banished too: hand jive with them.

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Clippy (the MC): one per Clippy Instructions window, the bottle first.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

OBJECTIVE The Bottle
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.bottle_open == true
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: The bottle: make them answer
  target: Night.bottle_pick
  text:
    Trabolta asks a personal question on the TV. When they answer it in front of everyone, 🗣. If they won't, 🙅. 🎩 only for a dead phone.
  buttons: truth_answered, truth_refused, chose_dare

OBJECTIVE Greet The Arrivals
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.step < 1
  act: Doors
  go: The Optical Drive
  title: Greet the arriving programs
  text:
    Greet people in person. Your scan greets them in your voice; it never clears anyone (only an Antivirus does).
  buttons: scan

// w18b: Jean Trabolta joins by video conference; no "no names"
// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Welcome Everyone
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "desktop" or Night.phase == "bingo"
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: Welcome everyone, then Computer Bingo
  text:
    The fundraiser to restore the sign at Maps And Ducks. Jean Trabolta joins by video conference later. Introduce Task Manager, Adobe Acrobat and the Recycling Bin. Bingo: 20 minutes, one line through the centre. A host starts 🎱 Bingo and calls ⏰ time: your booth pops up when your game is on.

// Wave 26 (B1): a guest pressed 🎱 BINGO!: Clippy checks that line first.
// It ends at the first 🎱 or 🎯 on anyone (↩ is dead from then on, so the
// card would hold a dead button): PLAYER SELECT is her NOW again.
// w26 (B1: check the caller's line, or ↩ undo it)
OBJECTIVE Check The Bingo
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "bingo_results" and Night.bingo_called == true and Night.bingo_checked != true and Night.bingo_winners < 1 and Night.bingo_named < 1 and Night.bingo_done != true
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: A program called BINGO: check their line
  target: Night.bingo_caller
  text:
    They pressed BINGO on their phone. Hear their line, centre square last. It holds: 🎱 (⭐ +10). It doesn't: ↩ Not a Bingo, and Bingo picks up with the time it had left.
  buttons: bingo_winner, not_a_bingo

// The checklist is PLAYER SELECT's steps, in order (wave 18, A5): each
// to-do leads with its button's glyph. Wave 26 (B3, B5): ④ 🤐 the winner
// names nobody; the first 🎯 or 🤐 ends the round, and the objective.
// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
// w26 (B3, B5: 🤐 names nobody; one round)
OBJECTIVE Celebrate The Winners
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "bingo_results" and Night.bingo_done != true
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: Celebrate the Bingo winners
  pick: program.location == "The Desktop" and program.cleared == true
  text:
    Winners read their line, centre square last. Demand applause. Tap each winner (⭐ +10), give the ribbon (⭐ +5), then tap the program they name at the centre square (⭐ +10): Norton interrupts. If they name nobody, 🤐 on the winner (⭐ +5). One round only. You never press 🛡.
    - 🎱 Who shouted BINGO?, done when Night.bingo_winners >= 1
    - 🎀 Give the winner the Bingo Ribbon, done when Night.bingo_ribbons >= 1
    - 🎯 Who did the winner name?, done when Night.bingo_named >= 1 or Night.bingo_none == true
    - 🤐 Or they name nobody, done when Night.bingo_none == true
  buttons: bingo_winner, award_the_ribbon, named_at_bingo, named_nobody

// Wave 26 (B5): the round is over; Clippy's NOW until 🤖.
// w26 (B5: one round)
OBJECTIVE After The Bingo
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "bingo_results" and Night.bingo_done == true
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: The Bingo is over: stay cheerful
  text:
    One round only. Let Norton do his job and reassure everyone; then a host introduces Trabolta.

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Introduce Trabolta
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "introduced" or Night.phase == "hunt_1"
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: Introduce Trabolta, then host the hunt
  text:
    Once a host fires 🤖: "Everyone, say hello to JEAN TRABOLTA!" Point at the reinstallation on the TV. Hand off: Trabolta has a game for all of us. A host starts 🔎 the hunt: it runs 15 minutes.

// w18b: Trabolta reads; 🍾 after Q3; no "confident answers" line
// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE The First Moment Of Truth Host
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "truth_1" and Night.judging == true
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: The First Moment of Truth
  text:
    Two minutes to file, then 📋 each question: Trabolta reads the result on the TV; when he has finished, the next. After Q3, 🍾 Truth or Dare (about five spins). The hosts call ⏱, 📋 and 🍾. Guesses are a symptom of corruption: 🤷 (⭐ +5). Never say which filings were lies.
    - Filings closed, done when Night.r1_closed == true
    - Q1 read, done when Night.results_q >= 1
    - Q2 read, done when Night.results_q >= 2
    - Q3 read, done when Night.results_q >= 3
    - 🍾 Truth or Dare, done when Night.bottle_picks >= 5 or Night.bottle_done == true
  buttons: uncertain_answer

OBJECTIVE Keep Everyone Calm
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "malware" or Night.phase == "hunt_2" or Night.phase == "summons"
  act: C
  title: Panic at the ad, then reassure
  text:
    Read Trabolta's private message. Overreact wildly, then pull it together: "There are signs of malware in the system that we need to be very vigilant about." Send everyone off for the hour.

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Judge Truth Pong
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "truth_pong" and Night.judging == true
  act: D
  go: The Cloud
  title: Judge the cup-makers' answers
  pick: program.may_answer == true
  text:
    It's Truth Time again! Only cup-makers answer. ✅ accurate or 😤 wrong but confident for the question being judged (Q1 to start; 🔢 under Also now moves it), 🤷 for a guess. ⭐ +5 each answer you judge.
  buttons: judge_accurate, judge_confident, uncertain_answer

OBJECTIVE Lead The Applause
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "trust_chart" or Night.phase == "beans"
  act: D
  go: The Desktop
  title: Lead the applause; the beans are malware
  text:
    Lead the applause for the most trusted. Don't defend the least trusted. Full of beans: "Routine operations like print to PDF are no longer working." Welcome the zipped programs back.

OBJECTIVE No Sides On Air
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "overshare" or Night.phase == "y2k" or Night.phase == "majority"
  act: E
  title: Keep everyone hunting; no sides on air
  text:
    The clock reset to 11 PM, December 31, 1999. The final facts are in the Quest Log. Programs will recruit: you may not take sides on air. At midnight, everyone back for the final reveal.

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE The Final Round
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "final_reveal"
  act: F
  go: The Desktop
  title: Lights down, everyone speaks
  text:
    Judge the final facts: ✅ / 😤 for the question being judged (Q1 to start; 🔢 moves it to Q2), 🤷 for a guess. ⭐ +5 each. Then: "There is only one version of the truth. Because truth is always in binary."
  buttons: judge_accurate, judge_confident, uncertain_answer

// 🔢 The question ✅ / 😤 judge (wave 21): after the judging objectives, so
// it rides Also now while judging is open.
OBJECTIVE Which Question
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.judging == true and (Night.phase == "truth_pong" or Night.phase == "final_reveal")
  title: 🔢 Which question are you judging?
  text:
    ✅ and 😤 judge one question at a time: question 1 when judging opens. When a program answers another, 🔢 to it first.
  buttons: judging_q1, judging_q2, judging_q3

OBJECTIVE Bob For It
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "bobbing" and Night.bag_up != true
  act: F
  title: Bobbing for Truth (with Adobe)
  text:
    Dejectedly: we are not worthy of the truth unless we are willing to Bob for it. Nothing moves until someone brings up the bag.
  buttons: brought_up_the_bag, failed_the_bob

OBJECTIVE Grok Prom
  // w21: Clippy left GROUP Hosts, so it is named.
  for: Hosts, Clippy
  while: Night.phase == "grok_prom" and Night.ended != true
  act: F
  title: Grok Prom: listen for the line
  text:
    The first program who says "You're the one that I want" to you: 💘 on their card (tap to arm, tap again to fire). Clippy: ⭐ +20.
  buttons: pickup_line_works

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Purgatory
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.ending == "destroyed" and Night.ceremony != true
  act: F
  go: The Desktop
  title: Dance, then read the summary
  text:
    After the dance a host calls 🪦 the summary: read it from the Desktop room. "We are now in purgatory forever together."

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Host The Ceremony
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.ceremony == true
  act: G
  go: The Desktop
  title: The awards ceremony
  text:
    The hosts call each award. If you host (after Combo B or the rave), each award line lands in the Desktop room: read it aloud, call the winner up, lead the applause. Otherwise lead the applause for Trabolta's. The three staff awards come last, and one might be yours.

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// The host parts: Task Manager, Adobe Acrobat, the Recycling Bin.
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

OBJECTIVE Summons Door
  for: Task Manager, Adobe Acrobat, Recycling Bin
  while: Night.summons_open == true
  act: C
  title: The summons: they check themselves in
  pick: program.cleared == true and program.summons_ok != true and program.afk != true and program.corrupted != true and program.gone != true and program.persona != true
  text:
    Programs scan the Desktop's check-in QR. 📍 on Still missing only for a dead or lost phone. Bathroom Mode excuses them.
  buttons: check_in_at_desktop

// Wave 26 (B2): Task Manager's results objective while a guest's call is
// unchecked: ↩ on the caller (its own objective, so the button is live
// whenever it is on the NOW card).
// w26 (B2: ↩ a false BINGO)
OBJECTIVE A Program Called Bingo
  for: Task Manager
  while: Night.phase == "bingo_results" and Night.bingo_called == true and Night.bingo_winners < 1 and Night.bingo_named < 1 and Night.bingo_done != true
  act: B
  go: The Desktop
  title: A program called BINGO: does the line hold?
  target: Night.bingo_caller
  text:
    They pressed BINGO on their phone. If Clippy finds no line, ↩ Not a Bingo on their card: Bingo picks up with the time it had left.
  buttons: not_a_bingo

// Wave 26 (B2): never while a guest's call is open: settle it first (🎱 or
// ↩), or a ↩ would leave a framed program behind.
// w26 (B5: one round)
OBJECTIVE The Fake Bingo Card
  for: Task Manager
  while: Night.phase == "bingo_results" and Night.bingo_winners < 1 and Night.bingo_called != true and Night.bingo_done != true
  act: B
  title: Nobody has a Bingo: hand Clippy the fake card
  text:
    Hand Clippy the pre-filled card, then press 🃏 on the anti-AI program's card (MS Paint unless the director changed it).
  buttons: frame_for_bingo

OBJECTIVE The Bank
  for: Task Manager
  while: Night.truther_sent == true and Night.ended != true
  act: C
  title: Be the bank (and the help desk)
  text:
    Programs move their own coin from their Wallet. You hold the cash bank: a deal made in person, a wrong amount, a refund the director asks for. Still answer # task-manager and your DMs.
  buttons: pay_truthcoin, charge_truthcoin

OBJECTIVE Judge The Cup
  for: Adobe Acrobat
  while: Night.phase == "truth_pong"
  act: D
  title: Truth Pong: judge the cup
  pick: program.cleared == true and program.pong_thrown != true and program.marked != true and program.corrupted != true and program.gone != true and program.persona != true
  text:
    Made: 🏓 Made (they may answer one round-2 fact). Missed: 🏓 Missed (marked: they light up on the Antivirus' Wanted board). Press Made for every sink: no cup on record, no counted filing.
  buttons: made_the_cup, missed_the_cup

OBJECTIVE Stand By The Printer
  for: Adobe Acrobat
  while: Night.printer_called == true and Night.beans != true and Night.ended != true
  act: D
  title: Stand by the printer
  text:
    VLC is asked to print a certificate. When the lid lifts and the beans show and the room heard nothing, 🫘 on VLC's card (tap to arm, tap again to fire).
  buttons: radio_beans

OBJECTIVE Hand Over Truth Txt
  for: Adobe Acrobat
  while: Night.phase == "bobbing" and Night.bag_up == true and Night.ended != true
  act: F
  title: Hand the bobber the truth.txt printout
  text:
    They read it aloud. When they finish, ⚖ the verdict is NEXT: fire it, or tell whoever is calling the show.

OBJECTIVE The Bag Of Truth
  for: Adobe Acrobat
  while: Night.phase == "bobbing" and Night.bag_up != true
  act: F
  title: The Bag of Truth goes in the tub
  text:
    Whoever surfaces with it: 🍎 Brought up the Bag. Comes up empty: 🍎 Failed the bob.
  buttons: brought_up_the_bag, failed_the_bob

OBJECTIVE The Porch
  for: Recycling Bin
  while: Night.step < 1
  act: Doors
  title: Porch and door: point every guest at the QR
  text:
    Candy for trick-or-treaters. Every guest scans the door QR; a featured guest scans their invitation. Lost or locked out: send them to Task Manager, the help desk. Never say a guest's real name.

OBJECTIVE Disk Cleanup
  for: Recycling Bin
  evergreen: true
  title: Keep Disk Cleanup moving
  text:
    Keep the line moving and the Bathroom Mode joke alive. Remind people to turn it off when they come out. A marked program keeps Bathroom Mode: never send them away from the toilet. NEXT sits above your taskbar: every host may call the show. 📣 I'll call tells the others who is calling (tap to arm, tap again to fire).
  buttons: award_the_ribbon, signed_the_painting

OBJECTIVE Documents And Printing
  for: Adobe Acrobat
  evergreen: true
  title: Documents and printing
  text:
    Relentlessly motivational, with a price tag. 🎀 ribbons, 🤝 vouches and 🩹 unmarks are yours any time. NEXT sits above your taskbar: every host may call the show. 📣 I'll call tells the others who is calling (tap to arm, tap again to fire).
  buttons: award_the_ribbon, signed_the_painting

OBJECTIVE The Help Desk
  for: Task Manager
  evergreen: true
  title: Keep things running: the help desk
  text:
    Answer # task-manager and your DMs: status reports, never plot. NEXT sits above your taskbar: every host may call the show. 📣 I'll call tells the others who is calling (tap to arm, tap again to fire).
  buttons: award_the_ribbon, signed_the_painting

// w21 (wave 21: points, no 🎤 bar, no All buttons…)
OBJECTIVE Help With That
  for: Clippy
  evergreen: true
  title: Offer everyone Help With That
  text:
    Relentlessly helpful, a little too bright, always available. 🎀 ribbons are yours any time, and 🖌 when MS Paint is here. Your staff quests are in the Quest Log, your instructions in the Codex. ⭐ for every game you run.
  buttons: award_the_ribbon, signed_the_painting

OBJECTIVE Whose Side Are You On Clippy
  for: Clippy
  while: Night.truther_sent == true and Night.ended != true
  evergreen: true
  title: Whose side are you on?
  text:
    You know what Trabolta is now. Stay his ambassador (⭐ and his trust), or turn. 📢 Defect openly: the whole house hears it, once. 🤫 Tip a marked program off, or 🤫 let a guess slide while you judge (accepted, +100 Truthcoin to them). Every third quiet favour, Trabolta notices.
  buttons: defect_openly, tip_off, let_it_slide
